---
import { lessons, siteLink, curriculumVersion } from '../data/course';
---
<div class="course-intro">
  <span class="eyebrow">A Microsoft Agent Framework + Foundry workshop</span>
  <p class="course-lead">Build something you can explain.</p>
  <p>Add one capability at a time to a .NET interview coach. Understand the choice, write the code, and see what changed.</p>
  <a class="primary-link" href={siteLink('workshop/00-orientation/')} data-continue data-base={import.meta.env.BASE_URL} data-version={curriculumVersion}>Start the workshop <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  <span class="course-meta">C# / .NET · Self-paced · One full day · 9 modules</span>
  <span class="course-meta" data-course-progress aria-live="polite">No account needed. Progress stays in this browser.</span>
</div>
<ol class="course-path">
  {lessons.map(([id, title, description], index) => (
    <li><a href={siteLink(`workshop/${id}/`)}>
      <span class="path-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index).padStart(2, '0')}</span>
      <div><strong>{title}</strong><p>{description}</p></div>
      <span class="path-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a></li>
  ))}
</ol>
<script>
  import { connectProgress } from '../scripts/progress';
  connectProgress();
</script>
